LangString WelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose where to install Dao for your Windows account. Your browsing data stays in your local Windows profile."
LangString DirectoryHelp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose a folder on your computer. Your browsing data stays in your Windows user profile."
LangString UpgradeHelp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao will be updated or repaired here. To move it, uninstall Dao first and keep your browsing data."
LangString LaunchDao ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Launch Dao"
LangString RequiresX64 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao requires 64-bit Windows."
LangString MachineInstallExists ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao is installed for all users. Uninstall that installation first, keeping your browsing data, then run this installer to choose a folder for your account."
LangString InvalidRegistration ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The existing Dao installation record is invalid. Repair or uninstall that installation before continuing."
LangString InvalidDirectory ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose a folder on a local fixed drive, using at most 180 characters. Windows, Program Files, the drive root, network paths and the Dao browsing-data folder cannot be used."
LangString DirectoryOccupied ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This folder already contains an Application or Temp directory. Choose another folder to protect existing files."
LangString DirectoryNotWritable ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao cannot write to this folder. Choose a folder that your Windows account can write to."
LangString Installing ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Dao. Please wait..."
LangString InstallFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao installation failed (code $ExitCode).$\r$\nDetails: $TEMP\dao_installer.log"
LangString UnexpectedDirectory ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao could not verify the installation in the selected folder.$\r$\nDetails: $TEMP\dao_installer.log"
LangString WelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Welcome to Dao"
LangString ThemeFont ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Segoe UI"
LangString WelcomeSubtitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A calmer space for your web."
LangString DirectoryLabel ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation folder"
LangString BrowseDirectory ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Browse..."
LangString InstallButton ${LANG_ENGLISH} "&Install Dao"
LangString RepairButton ${LANG_ENGLISH} "&Update / repair"
LangString InstallingTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Getting Dao ready"
LangString InstallingSubtitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing to your selected folder."
LangString FinishTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "You're all set"
LangString FinishSubtitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Your next chapter starts here."
LangString FinishText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Dao is installed and ready whenever you are."
